From 59442cf346ccffbc2a9559a6f60d9ee183dd3e84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juuso Alasuutari <juuso.alasuutari@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 09:53:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] runtime: add per-pass sharpening and color preservation
 stages

This commit adds Controls::sharpness and colour_preserve and
RuntimeConfig::pass_stages. With pass_stages, the runtime records
shaders/passes/pass_stages.comp after every pass. Sharpening adds the
detail above a 3x3 blur. Color preservation removes a fraction of the
pass's chroma change relative to the frame the first pass saw.
build_network.py builds the new shader.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
